{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only the host needs to own this DLC. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2- 5</strong> Players | Ages <strong>13 &amp; Up</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>15-30</strong> Minutes Playing Time<strong></strong><br><br><strong>Instant Workshop... Infinite Possibilities!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build adorable robots and golems, with just one finger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Widget\u2019s Workshop</strong> features an innovative blend of card crafting and set collection, within a real-world, spatial game environment. You start by dropping 80 custom-shaped part cards onto the table, creating a giant, messy pile of parts in the center. Players take turns pulling parts from the pile, using one finger only, attempting to find the best parts for their robots and golems under construction. The fact that many part cards are partially hidden in the rubble, or even flipped upside down, enables exciting deduction and push-your-luck moments. You win the game if you can complete the most optimized set of adorable constructs in your workshop!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1621114?t=1741800998","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621114/e4e5419163686eb6f9ad3013e4fc7b3bb925f82e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741800998","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621114/249311acb6e0bf6952a1394dd4dfd7173859b973/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741800998","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1621114/249311acb6e0bf6952a1394dd4dfd7173859b973/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741800998","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-o